  "calendar": "ID",
  "about": "Indonesia: weekdays when Bank Indonesia does not run BI-RTGS/SKNBI. Base = national holidays and cuti bersama from each year's joint ministerial decree (SKB, plus Keppres on cuti bersama for civil servants (ASN) and election-day Keppres). Since at least 2019, BI's Lebaran/Idul Adha/year-end notices close BI-RTGS and SKNBI on every cuti bersama day (2019, 2021, 2022, 2023, 2024, 18 Aug 2025 checked). Before that BI sometimes ran RTGS on cuti bersama days (2013, 2014, 2017 found), and stayed open on the 2018 Pilkada holiday; those days (2013-08-05/06, 2014-08-01, 2017-06-30, 2018-06-27) are simply not closures here. No weekend moves. Covers 2010-2027 (SKB for 2027 signed 15 Sep 2026).",
